WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
The Bible's first chapter says that
God created humans in his own image.

2
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.460
So Christians see every
person as having dignity,

3
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:12.430
reason, freedom and the
capacity to love God.

4
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.820
Yet Christians also speak of salvation:
being rescued from sin and death.

5
00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:22.970
If humans are made in God's image, why
do Christians say everyone needs saving?

6
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.450
In this mission, you'll
compare how Catholic,

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.810
Orthodox and Protestant Christians
read the story of Adam and Eve.

8
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.370
Then you'll see what Christians hope for:

9
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.160
resurrection, and the Kingdom of God.

10
00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:39.470
Your mission: find out why
Christians say everyone needs saving.
